id: combat-telepath
name: Combat Telepath
advancement: true
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score of 6+
tpCost: 5
# "If you win the Clash against an Opponent with Mind Reading, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(bT) against them until the
# end of your next turn" - the Telepathic Read mark beside the Mind Read one.
mindTelepath: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Mind Reading won: Combat Rolls against them 1(bT) higher until the end of your next turn.
text: >
  Combat Telepath: You can enhance your combat abilities by reading the minds of your enemies.
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score of 6+
  –TP Cost: 5
  –Effect: If you win the Clash against an Opponent with Mind Reading, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(bT) against them
  until the end of your next turn.
